urd. (-कम्) an absurdity, an impossibility. -उद्यम् falsehood, lying, a false statement; तत् किं मन्यसे राजपुत्रि मृषोद्यं तदिति U.4; मृषोद्यं प्रवदन्तीं ताम् Bk.5.6. -ज्ञानम् ignorance, error. -दानम् insincere promise of a gift. -भाषिन्, -वादिन् m. a liar. -वाच् f. an untrue or satirical speech, satire, irony.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "वादः an untrue speech; a lie, falsehood.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "insincere speech, flattery.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "irony, satire. -साक्षिन् false witness.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["mRShaa", "mṛṣā"], "synonyms_slp1": ["mRShaa", "mṛṣā"]}], "mfsayate": [{"id": "mfzAyate", "headword": "मृषायते", "headword_slp1": "mfzAyate", "fold": "mfsayate", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "मृषायते [mṛṣāyatē], Den. Ā. To be mistaken, to err.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["mRShaayate", "mṛṣāyate"], "synonyms_slp1": ["mRShaayate", "mṛṣāyate"]}], "mfsalakaH": [{"id": "mfzAlakaH", "headword": "मृषालकः", "headword_slp1": "mfzAlakaH", "fold": "mfsalakaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "मृषालकः [mṛṣālakḥ], The mango tree.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["mRShaalaka", "mRShaalakaH", "mṛṣālaka", "mṛṣālakaḥ", "मृषालक"], "synonyms_slp1": ["mRShaalaka", "mRShaalakaH", "mṛṣālaka", "mṛṣālakaḥ", "mfzAlaka"]}], "mfswa": [{"id": "mfzwa", "headword": "मृष्ट", "headword_slp1": "mfzwa", "fold": "mfswa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "apte-sa", "senses": [{"gloss": "मृष्ट [mṛṣṭa], p. p. [मृज् मृश् वा-क्त]", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(a) Cleansed, purified; शरच्छशिकरैर्मृष्टं मानयन् रजनीमुखम् Bhāg.3.2.34. (b) Pure, clean; भक्षयित्वा फलान्यथ । मूलानि च सुमृष्टानि... Rām.7.93.8.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Besmeared.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Dressed, cooked.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Touched; स्थितपतितं च करोति मृष्टमन्नम् Bṛi. S.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "Consi